# behavior: a directory holding the retired `incan.toml` and no `loaf.toml` stops project discovery with an error that names the file and asks for the rename, for check, run, test and build, rather than being stepped over to an enclosing project (#1008)
# cli-commands:
#   oven check legacy/src/main.incn
#   oven run legacy/src/main.incn
#   oven test legacy/tests/test_legacy.incn
#   oven build legacy/src/main.incn
# expect-exit: 1
# expect-stderr-contains:
#   legacy/incan.toml
#   rename it to loaf.toml

def main() -> None:
    println("the enclosing project is not the legacy directory's project")
